  "acceptanceCriteria": [
    {
      "criterion_index": 1,
      "evidence": [
        "A sealed v19 report counts distinct canonical item revisions while separately retaining discovery-path contributions and within-item source/route pair counts. Exact snapshot/filter-bound drill returns the counted item revisions and retained source paths; source-boundary comparison uses the same snapshot and makes no counterfactual claim. Capped known-value lists direct users to the exact all-known drill instead of implying a residual-only filter.",
        "Identifier, year, venue, language, discipline, OA and full-text fields carry known/not-reported/unknown/unavailable states with exact retained, rights-authorized witnesses; missing values are not imputed and metadata permission does not grant source full-text access. Protected reads recheck rights and sealed integrity after restart. Expired or changed-but-allowing historical witnesses deny and durably audit the read without persisting a false policy allow."
      ]
    },
    {
      "criterion_index": 2,
      "evidence": [
        "Fresh exact-candidate report tests (19), desktop tests (34), portable/Core contract tests (197), Core API/service tests (21), native route/size tests (2), and affected corpus, architecture, quality and UI-gate checks pass. Report tests include two-source/one-item path multiplicity, one-source/two-item denominators, exact drill, unknown fields, rights denial, rollback, replay, restart and populated v18 migration.",
        "A real Windows principal with DPAPI/SQLCipher exercises policy replay, restart and revocation at the protected Core boundary. Stale historical report reads prove both denial and content-free durable audit with no tentative allow decision retained."
      ]
    },
    {
      "criterion_index": 3,
      "evidence": [
        "Portable v1 report schema/TypeScript fixtures, Core OpenAPI/client, v19 additive storage and frozen v18 recovery fixtures are updated and drift checks pass. Report snapshots seal source and rights witnesses, exact member hashes, provenance and outbox atomically; failed creation leaves no partial report. Stale read denials append a separate content-free provenance event after rollback.",
        "Architecture and storage guidance document the new protected adapter and audit boundary. Additive quality inventory precedes governed renderer implementation; the unchanged approved UI reference 1.7 is bound by the task contract. Independent task review and later slice-wide performance/profile qualification remain distinct gates."
      ]
    }
  ],
